# The tools of the vulnerability gate (.github/workflows/audit.yml). Pinned with hashes
# (requirements.txt next to it): a checking tool that comes from the index in the newest version
# on every run is itself an unchecked part of the supply chain.
# Deliberately NOT `requirements.in`: with that name Dependabot would take requirements.txt for a
# pip-compile output and regenerate it with pip-compile instead of bumping the lines with their hashes.
pip-audit
uv
